# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# What this record settles, and what it leaves to others
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
this_record_owns=The invocation's outcome: how the process ended, how long it took, what it wrote, and the version, interpreter, target, configuration and credential state it ran under.
this_record_does_not_own=The dataset rows and their reconciliation, the per-tool status contract, the severity literal tally and the run-wide index. Those belong to oss-scan-results/findings.json, findings.csv, tool-status.md, severity-map.md and run-record.md, which cite the measurements here rather than take them again.
no_judgement=Nothing here characterises any finding as real, important, a false positive or a duplicate of another tool's, and nothing here compares this tool with another.
self_digest_note=This file's own byte size and sha256 belong to the artifact-tree manifest oss-scan-results/run-record.md owns; a file cannot carry its own digest.
